monitor/watcher/test-link-nexus-tools.sh	local	no-claude-bin	unguarded	pinned	Symlink farm under test; the link is the subject, never executed; step 2; reach=0 @blob 436f946 @127ff1f.
monitor/watcher/test-notify-gate.sh	path	no-claude-bin	unguarded	no-resolver	Invokes $WORK/fakebin/claude by ABSOLUTE path; no resolution occurs; reach=0 @blob e0b1492 @127ff1f.
monitor/watcher/test-pane-state.sh	path	no-claude-bin	unguarded	no-resolver	Stub is backgrounded by absolute path purely so the pane's comm reads claude; reach=0 @blob 8aa1e14 @127ff1f. (The issue guessed this one correctly.)
monitor/watcher/test-respawn-loop-integration.sh	path	no-claude-bin	guarded	exposed	The site #746 reported and #759 fixed. Measured: resolved to the decoy locals copy, not its own stub, and the guard refused.
